  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Solar Panel
  description: The Solar stand module helps in studying the characteristics of photovoltaic
    in a simplified form. It includes a photovoltaic panel and a halogen fixture
    simulating sunlight and heat. The panel tilt angle and seasonal sun positions
    can be adjusted to study effects of sunlight intensity, temperature, and sun
    angles.
